<title>DUBAI: GOLF-TORRANCE OUT OF DESERT CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-TORRANCE OUT OF DESERT CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryder Cup veteran Sam Torrance of Scotland became the second man to withdraw from this week's Desert Classic on Tuesday because of personal problems.</p>
<p>According to a tournament spokesman, Torrance's wife Suzanne is unwell.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, Argentina's Eduardo Romero withdrew for health reasons. The event begins on Thursday.</p>
</text>
